{
    "nodes": [
        {
            "id": "439559e0-b410-4658-aad5-4310d362365b",
            "index": 0,
            "characterId": "ed1baf90-69f0-402f-959a-2683ad667ded",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3160",
            "content": {
                "en": "(…I’m back again? But just now I clearly—)",
                "zh": "（……我又回来了？刚才明明——）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 198.39999389648438,
            "positionY": 100.80000305175781,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "94a3c911-0ec6-4fd5-aea2-6dd26f1c6fb5",
            "index": 1,
            "characterId": "e3614b9a-4789-4305-ac57-4a6bac607584",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3161",
            "content": {
                "en": "Don’t turn back. Listen to me first.",
                "zh": "别回去。先听我说。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 539.2000122070313,
            "positionY": 100.80000305175781,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "f3029f26-dcc0-4121-a475-1790464bd636",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "03fbd1fc-0e37-4fb2-abea-a8bb2982cffb",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3162",
            "content": {
                "en": "Noema?! Where did you go just now? What is going on here?!",
                "zh": "梦之？！你刚才去哪了？这里到底怎么回事！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 874.4000244140625,
            "positionY": 100.80000305175781,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "f74577e4-b5dc-4431-98e8-46c2c7888896",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "7324b771-f6f5-4d90-b605-0ae0697e44d9",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3163",
            "content": {
                "en": "Something’s wrong with this street. It loops you back into the same stretch of road, and the moment you make one wrong choice, it takes you away.",
                "zh": "这条街有些不对劲。它会把人绕进同一段路里，直到你走错一次，就会被带走。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1210.39990234375,
            "positionY": 100.80000305175781,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "92bdafe7-6105-4f0f-96a5-db7fc9c0a241",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "066100ef-5e3a-4a3f-8313-9da8c2998323",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3164",
            "content": {
                "en": "Then how do I get out?",
                "zh": "那我该怎么走出去？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1540.0,
            "positionY": 100.80000305175781,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "751f40b9-8122-4bec-b975-8da3b5a3528d",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "5c2350da-c9c0-447f-8406-60bff21a53f5",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3165",
            "content": {
                "en": "Remember this: the first time you pass through, the street is safe. That’s the correct answer.",
                "zh": "记住，第一次通过的路是安全的，是正确答案。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1872.0,
            "positionY": 100.80000305175781,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "cb4a7ae2-c242-45e9-8170-249ad91aeb7a",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "7324b771-f6f5-4d90-b605-0ae0697e44d9",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3166",
            "content": {
                "en": "After that, every time you come through, compare it to the first run—if you spot anything abnormal, back out to the left immediately; if everything looks normal, keep going right.",
                "zh": "之后每次都要对照：有异常就立刻向左退回；一切正常就继续向右前进。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2205.599853515625,
            "positionY": 100.80000305175781,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "bfff4546-7e09-48c9-b12d-fa5d02215c07",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "547590f1-5207-4943-a81f-41ae946214ce",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3167",
            "content": {
                "en": "Abnormal… like what?",
                "zh": "异常……指什么？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2540.0,
            "positionY": 100.80000305175781,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "7259caf3-7ff3-4ccb-8bbc-0a250ada9191",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "5c2350da-c9c0-447f-8406-60bff21a53f5",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3168",
            "content": {
                "en": "Anything that “shouldn’t be there.” Extra people, one less stall, something strange on the wall… anything like that.",
                "zh": "任何“不该出现”的东西。多一些人、少一个摊位、墙上有奇怪的东西……",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2878.39990234375,
            "positionY": 104.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "66aaed21-a9a7-4bfa-972d-0d2e8331c4dc",
            "index": 9,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3169",
            "content": {
                "en": "(…Stay calm. Compare it to the first street, find what’s off, and choose the right direction.)",
                "zh": "（……我得冷静。对照第一次的街道，找异常，走对方向。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3206.39990234375,
            "positionY": 104.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        }
